at Azaleah suspects \"foul play.\" And when the special effects on Nia's costume don't work at dress rehearsal, Nia is a nervous wreck. To top it all off, the high school journalism class is covering the performance for the school blog, and the director doesn't have time to replace Nia's costume. Nia has to wear it without the special effects. Azaleah becomes determined to make sure the musical isn't ruined for Nia. Azaleah has to get to the bottom of the mysterious rehearsal troubles, and finish party preparations, before the curtain goes up.","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/6cf89344938084f1b92219093d02902dd188ec2aaf672f74a5a482d7c8844d80/Fgj-C5puUdUOSKS80QiFWigtyQl65Qa5yPo66c8gp2w.mp3","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/R7lq0URi_0PjJwWn9Pt0p8gelaFGxSTV-92rFE0csdk"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":4408,"fileSize":54734796,"hasStreams":false},"status":{"name":"complete","updatedAt":"2025-11-17T14:29:24.671Z"}},"cardId":"iaFDD","createdAt":"2025-03-03T09:25:21.509Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-10T15:50:04.007Z"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}